@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Capability Graph Build
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Manifest Intake" as Manifests
rectangle "Rhai Declaration Intake" as Rhai
rectangle "Type/Trait Validation" as Types
rectangle "Callback Validation" as Callbacks
rectangle "Capability Instance Staging" as Stage
rectangle "Fixed-Point Convergence" as Fixed
rectangle "Diagnostics" as Diag

Manifests --> Rhai : identifies declared files for
Rhai --> Types : supplies type material to
Types --> Callbacks : supplies trait bounds to
Callbacks --> Stage : supplies callback masks to
Stage --> Fixed : converges staged graph into
Types --> Diag : reports invalid type graph to
Callbacks --> Diag : reports invalid callback graph to
Fixed --> Diag : reports non-convergence to
@enduml
